title: "Early Gradient Spectra Predict Useful Low-Rank Adaptation"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Ruge Lin"
version: "v1.0.2-publication"
date-released: "2026-06-28"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible theory-and-evidence package for activation-whitened
  early-gradient spectra as diagnostics for useful LoRA rank, with controlled
  matrix simulations, synthetic-transformer allocation tests, and scoped
  GPT-2/WikiText-2 validation.
keywords:
